# The positive case matching paramtype_declared_int_float_literal.rib: a
# token declared uniform integer given an integer literal parses cleanly
# and emits no diagnostic. tests/paramlistdeclaredtype_test.cpp also drives
# this fixture in-process, through its own GMANRenderManImpl subclass, to
# read the value RiSurfaceV actually received back as RtInt.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Declare "myint" "uniform integer"
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Surface "plastic" "myint" [4]
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
WorldEnd
